To say neither in Romansh, put 'na' before the verb. The first time you use 'ni' in a clause, it means 'neither', however the second time it means 'nor'. e.g:

* Jau na sun ni bain ni fitg bain --> I am neither well nor very well
* El na mangia ni ina tschagula ni in tartuffel --> He eats neither an onion nor a potato